Kc5 32. Ne3 a5 $1 { ⩱ Gaining space on the queenside, speculating with the threat ...Kb4-a3 to create a queenside passed pawn. } 33. Rc1+ ( { An option was } 33. a3 b5 34. Nc2 Ne4 35. Rd4 { but after } Nc3 { (threatening ...Bf5) } 36. b4 axb4 37. axb4 Kd6 38. Rd3 Rc8 $15 { Black stays in control. } ) 
